WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 7b37e00e9bfb162d5c3033b9ffc6d876

00:00:00.234 --> 00:00:02.394
Habari, karibu kwenye video nyingine ya Uchambuzi wa Kina.

00:00:02.714 --> 00:00:05.514
Safari hii tunaangalia Saladi ya Nasibu.

00:00:05.993 --> 00:00:11.273
Hili ni zoezi ambalo unatumia
namba za nasibu kutengeneza saladi.

00:00:12.173 --> 00:00:16.393
Hapa tuna orodha ya maagizo
ya kile utakachotengeneza.

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:19.193
Na jambo kuu unalotumia
ni kitendakazi hiki cha makeSalad

00:00:19.193 --> 00:00:22.553
chenye idadi fulani ya majani,
idadi fulani ya nyanya,

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:25.993
idadi fulani ya vipande vya mkate
na idadi fulani ya zeituni.

00:00:26.544 --> 00:00:30.623
Na kazi yako ni kutumia namba za
nasibu kupata idadi hizi tofauti

00:00:30.853 --> 00:00:35.863
za vitu hivi. Na tuna kitendakazi
hiki cha Math.randomInt ambacho

00:00:35.863 --> 00:00:36.384
tutakitumia.

00:00:37.584 --> 00:00:41.624
Katika msimbo wa kuanzia nakupa makeSalad hii

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:44.183
ikiwa na namba za nasibu
ambazo nimeziandika

00:00:44.183 --> 00:00:49.344
moja kwa moja, na tukibonyeza hapa tunaweza
kuona kwamba saladi inatengenezwa.

00:00:49.643 --> 00:00:55.234
Unaona tuna majani kadhaa,
nyanya kadhaa, vipande vya mkate hapa,

00:00:55.314 --> 00:00:56.993
na vipande vya zeituni.

00:00:58.243 --> 00:01:02.594
Nilifurahia kuchagua picha
zinazokusanyika kutengeneza saladi.

00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:07.834
Kazi zote hizo ndogo za nyuma ya pazia
ambazo zinameza muda,

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:12.274
kujaribu kuchagua picha za majani
ya saladi kwa ajili ya zoezi hili.

00:01:13.713 --> 00:01:16.114
Sawa, basi tunajaribu kufanya nini hapa?

00:01:16.433 --> 00:01:21.614
Tunajaribu kupata idadi
ya majani haya, nyanya,

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:24.373
vipande vya mkate na zeituni. Lakini kuna
sheria kadhaa tunazopaswa kufuata.

00:01:25.013 --> 00:01:29.093
Basi tuanze na. Kwa kweli,
hebu tuvitoe hivi nje na tuwe na

00:01:30.853 --> 00:01:33.013
baadhi ya variable za vitu hivi.

00:01:33.813 --> 00:01:38.293
Tunataka variable ya majani,
tuiweke tu 100.

00:01:38.614 --> 00:01:42.614
Tunataka variable ya nyanya,
tuiweke tu 10.

00:01:42.933 --> 00:01:46.293
Tuwe na variable ya vipande vya mkate, 8.

00:01:46.674 --> 00:01:51.153
Na tuwe na variable ya zeituni
ambayo tutaiweka 5.

00:01:52.034 --> 00:01:53.793
Tuangalie kama inafanya kazi, na inafanya.

00:01:54.513 --> 00:01:58.513
Basi tujiweke katika umbo la
msingi linaloeleweka hapa.

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:01.394
Natumaini hayo yote yako wazi kabisa.

00:02:01.634 --> 00:02:04.834
Kufikia sasa umekuwa ukitumia variable
nyingi na vitendakazi vingi.

00:02:04.834 --> 00:02:06.114
Kwa hiyo hii inapaswa kuwa wazi kabisa.

00:02:06.433 --> 00:02:09.234
Basi tutaanza na,
majani yetu.

00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:11.873
Tunahitaji majani kati ya 40 na 100.

00:02:12.153 --> 00:02:19.354
Na jinsi tunavyofanya hivyo ni kutumia
Math.randomInt hii kati ya majani 40 na 100.

00:02:20.954 --> 00:02:24.074
Na haya, tuna majani kadhaa humu.

00:02:24.794 --> 00:02:25.193
Basi

00:02:26.633 --> 00:02:28.873
nini hasa kinatokea hapa? Nukta hii ni nini?

00:02:29.383 --> 00:02:32.473
Namba hizi mbili ni nini? Hebu
tulizungumzie hili kwa ufupi sana.

00:02:32.633 --> 00:02:33.033
Basi

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:36.794
hiki ndicho tunachokiita, namespace.

00:02:37.843 --> 00:02:41.843
Katika JavaScript huenda pia
kwa kweli ni constant,

00:02:42.084 --> 00:02:47.443
lakini kimsingi ni kitu tunachotumia
kukusanya pamoja idadi ya,

00:02:48.443 --> 00:02:49.123
vitendakazi tofauti.

00:02:50.243 --> 00:02:52.204
Na huenda hii hata ni metodu.

00:02:52.204 --> 00:02:55.644
Kwa kweli, hapa, nadhani katika baadhi ya lugha
hiki kingekuwa kitendakazi ndani ya namespace.

00:02:55.644 --> 00:02:57.764
Katika baadhi ya lugha kingekuwa
metodu ya constant.

00:02:57.924 --> 00:02:59.843
Hakuna kati ya haya kinachokuhusu
sana kwa sasa.

00:03:00.003 --> 00:03:02.084
Tutashughulikia hayo yote
baadaye sana.

00:03:02.324 --> 00:03:05.283
Kinachohusika kwa sasa ni kwamba unaweza
kufikiria Math kama, kama

00:03:05.683 --> 00:03:08.723
aina ya fungu la vitendakazi
ambavyo tutavitumia.

00:03:09.283 --> 00:03:13.204
Na kimoja kati ya vitendakazi hivi tunavyotumia
hapa kinaitwa randomInt.

00:03:13.604 --> 00:03:16.123
Na randomInt inakupa tu namba kamili.

00:03:16.123 --> 00:03:22.883
Namba kamili ni namba nzima. 1,
2, 3, 4, si 1.5 wala 7.6.

00:03:23.364 --> 00:03:27.683
Kwa hiyo hii si namba kamili, si namba kamili.

00:03:28.084 --> 00:03:30.003
Ilhali tukiwa na, sijui,

00:03:30.894 --> 00:03:34.574
56 au 556, hii ni namba kamili.

00:03:35.454 --> 00:03:39.774
Hizi tunaziita desimali
na hizi tunaziita namba kamili.

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:45.693
Katika lugha nyingine unaweza
pia kuiita hii decimal.

00:03:46.813 --> 00:03:49.933
Decimal,
kwa sababu ina nukta ya desimali ndani yake.

00:03:50.014 --> 00:03:51.093
Lakini hatutaziangalia hizi.

00:03:51.093 --> 00:03:55.054
JavaScript haina hizi. JavaScript
ina aina hizi mbili tu za namba.

00:03:56.114 --> 00:04:00.104
Na kwa hiyo randomInt
inaturejeshea namba kamili,

00:04:01.223 --> 00:04:04.024
lakini ni kitendakazi tu. Unaweza
kukifikiria tu kama kitendakazi.

00:04:04.024 --> 00:04:08.424
Kinatokea tu kuwa na aina hii ya namespace
mwanzoni, yenye nukta ndani yake.

00:04:09.783 --> 00:04:14.903
Basi kwa nyanya zetu, tunasema tunahitaji
nyanya tano, lakini zisizozidi

00:04:15.223 --> 00:04:18.343
moja kwa kila majani matano. Sawa, basi tunahitaji

00:04:19.624 --> 00:04:23.374
idadi ya nasibu ya nyanya ambayo,
ambayo iko kati ya,

00:04:24.303 --> 00:04:26.814
isiyozidi moja kwa kila majani matano.

00:04:27.053 --> 00:04:31.694
Kwa hiyo itakuwa leaves,
ikigawanywa kwa tano.

00:04:31.774 --> 00:04:33.064
Kwa hiyo hiki ndicho kiwango chetu cha juu

00:04:33.894 --> 00:04:38.254
tunachoweza kuwa nacho, na kiwango
chetu cha chini ni nyanya tano.

00:04:38.814 --> 00:04:39.454
Kwa hiyo tunataka

00:04:40.574 --> 00:04:45.213
namba kati ya tano na idadi
ya majani ikigawanywa kwa tano.

00:04:46.814 --> 00:04:49.053
Na hii ni randomInt.

00:04:50.103 --> 00:04:52.903
Sawa, kwa hiyo hiyo inatupa nyanya zetu.

00:04:53.384 --> 00:04:54.903
Sasa tunahitaji vipande vyetu vya mkate.

00:04:55.704 --> 00:04:58.543
Lazima tuwe na vipande vya mkate
vya kufyonza maji ya nyanya,

00:04:58.543 --> 00:05:02.264
lakini hatuwezi kuwa navyo vingi mno,
la sivyo ni bakuli la mkate tu.

00:05:02.663 --> 00:05:06.504
Kwa hiyo tuna vipande vya mkate
angalau sawa na idadi ya nyanya.

00:05:06.663 --> 00:05:11.384
Kwa hiyo kiwango cha chini cha vipande
vya mkate tutakachokuwa nacho ni tomatoes,

00:05:11.783 --> 00:05:16.423
lakini kisizidi mara mbili. Kwa hiyo kiwango
chetu cha juu ni tomatoes mara mbili.

00:05:18.403 --> 00:05:20.163
Na mwisho kabisa, zeituni zetu.

00:05:22.564 --> 00:05:25.603
Zeituni zina ladha kali, kwa hiyo
tunataka kuzitumia kwa uangalifu.

00:05:25.684 --> 00:05:27.684
Tunataka angalau zeituni moja,

00:05:29.444 --> 00:05:34.163
kwa hiyo angalau moja, lakini
zisizozidi nusu ya idadi ya nyanya,

00:05:34.963 --> 00:05:37.603
kwa hiyo zisizozidi tomatoes ikigawanywa kwa mbili.

00:05:38.803 --> 00:05:41.124
Na hiyo inatupa saladi yetu ya nasibu,

00:05:42.494 --> 00:05:44.334
ambayo sasa ni tofauti
kidogo kila mara.

00:05:44.494 --> 00:05:47.374
Na tunaweza kupitia mojawapo ya hizi
haraka tu ili kuona inavyofanya kazi.

00:05:47.853 --> 00:05:53.374
Kwa hiyo tunachagua idadi yoyote ya majani
kutoka 40 hadi 100, na tunapata 72.

00:05:54.014 --> 00:06:02.973
Kisha tunasema tunataka namba kati ya
5 na 14.4, ambayo ni 72 ikigawanywa kwa 5.

00:06:03.533 --> 00:06:05.574
Na katika hali hiyo, hali hii,
inatupa 11.

00:06:05.574 --> 00:06:13.093
Kwa hiyo tunapata nyanya 11,
kisha tunapata kati ya 11 na 22,

00:06:13.213 --> 00:06:18.713
yaani nyanya 11 mara 2. Na mwisho kabisa,
tunapata kati ya 1 na

00:06:19.514 --> 00:06:23.994
nusu ya idadi ya nyanya,
ambayo ni 5.5, na hiyo inatupa 4.

00:06:24.473 --> 00:06:30.713
Na kwa hiyo tunachopata mwishoni ni 72,
11, 13, na 4.

00:06:32.793 --> 00:06:34.634
Basi hivyo ndivyo unavyotengeneza saladi ya nasibu.

00:06:35.994 --> 00:06:38.673
Natumaini si ngumu sana.
Ukifuata mantiki hatua kwa hatua,

00:06:38.673 --> 00:06:39.913
haipaswi kuwa ngumu sana.

00:06:41.574 --> 00:06:44.134
Lakini ukiwa na maswali yoyote
au kitu chochote hakieleweki,

00:06:44.134 --> 00:06:47.894
tafadhali njoo uyaulize kwenye jukwaa
au uandike maoni kwenye video ya YouTube.

00:06:48.213 --> 00:06:51.093
Asante kwa kutazama. Tutaonana katika
video nyingine ya Uchambuzi wa Kina hivi karibuni.

00:06:51.093 --> 00:06:51.814
Kwaheri kwa sasa.
